**Files:** Extend `src/core/entities.ts` (all record constructors with copy-on-construct + deep freeze), `src/core/lineage.ts` (`validateDescriptor`); Test `tests/conformance/a.test.ts` + `tests/unit/lineage.test.ts` + ownership assertions.

