  - C-2 cycle `V1 → V2 → V1`: `cycles` exactly the cycle; declarations preserved; no throw; registry intact; continuing cycle into `evaluateBinding` yields `CYCLE_DETECTED` (never a success); read-only structural queries still answerable.
